# SwiftFormat config for Ollin.
#
# Ollin's source is hand-tuned — intentional column alignment, inline loop
# bodies, dense doc-comments, blank lines kept at the start of a scope. A default
# autoformatter rewrites ~85% of the files and fights all of that. So this config
# is an *allowlist*: only the safe-hygiene rules below ever run (`--rules` replaces
# the default set entirely), and they're verified to be a zero-change no-op on the
# current tree. The opinionated rules (indent, wrapping, blank-line placement,
# import sorting, redundantSelf) stay off on purpose — they're not "wrong", they
# just don't match this codebase's deliberate style.
#
# Run by the pre-commit hook (lint-only) and by `Scripts/format.sh` (apply).

--swiftversion 6.0

--rules linebreakAtEndOfFile,trailingSpace,consecutiveBlankLines,duplicateImports,redundantParens,redundantReturn,spaceInsideBrackets,spaceInsideParens,spaceInsideBraces,spaceAroundBraces,emptyBraces,redundantBackticks

# Never touch vendored third-party source or build output.
--exclude External,.build,DerivedData
